{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDWKazvNz36BTWJcFkDc", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：** 里约热内卢的 **Teatro Lyrico Fluminense**（弗卢米嫩塞抒情剧院），时间是 1869 年 11 月 24 日。他于同年 12 月 18 日在蒂茹卡（Tijuca）的旅馆去世。\n\n关于病因，各来源说法不一。维基百科等多数来源说是黄热病，也有来源说是疟疾，或是阑尾炎引起的腹膜炎。剧院名称各来源一致。\n\n我只搜了 1 次。\n\nSources:\n- [Louis Moreau Gottschalk - Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louis_Moreau_Gottschalk)\n- [Louis Moreau Gottschalk - 64 Parishes](https://64parishes.org/?p=37116)\n- [Tamino Autographs: Louis Moreau Gottschalk](https://www.taminoautographs.com/blogs/autograph-blog/louis-moreau-gottschalk-the-first-great-american-composer)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1209, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4298, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1209}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:41:38.622Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDWKaiJ8Zy37XRpJg5Nh"}
